rsion and live_sha256 were refreshed for the nine entries whose live version had changed (those three plus evidence-graph, omega-notification-worker, omega-runtime-gateway, omega-media-worker, omega-provider-worker, omega-knowledge-embedding-worker); the other entries kept their recorded values because their live versions were unchanged. Hashes were transcribed from the tool output and not independently byte-compared against source."
